<h1>About Wheelhouse</h1>
<p class="lead">Wheelhouse is a neighbourhood bicycle repair shop. We fix bikes, and we keep track of every repair so you never have to wonder what was done or when it's ready.</p>

<h2>Our approach</h2>
<p>We diagnose before we work, we price from one public list, and we keep a full repair history for every bike — not just its current owner.</p>
